    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16885" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσφάρᾰγος</span></b>  (B) [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φᾰ],
