		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stone sperage, Asparagus
				acutifolius,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				325
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Amips.
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				301
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theopomp.Com.
				68
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>the edible shoots thereof,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				6.4.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.125
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.325
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Autom.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.641
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
